# M5Stack StickS3: the first board of the project. The values in the code
# are its values, and a build without a board file is a build for it.
# A board file comes after sdkconfig.defaults and names the chip and the
# board; ESP-IDF then also reads sdkconfig.defaults.<chip>:
# idf.py -DSDKCONFIG_DEFAULTS="sdkconfig.defaults;boards/<name>.defaults" build
CONFIG_IDF_TARGET="esp32s3"
CONFIG_HWPASS_BOARD_STICKS3=y
